WEBVTT

00:08.300 --> 00:09.970
Those aren't Eins' eyes.

00:09.970 --> 00:13.100
It's the power of hatred borrowed from the Onikirimaru.

00:14.680 --> 00:16.140
Get out of my way!

00:20.380 --> 00:21.440
Grandma!

00:22.550 --> 00:24.580
Stay with me, Grandma!

00:26.120 --> 00:29.150
As long as I have been the Tamayori princess,

00:29.990 --> 00:34.160
I knew this day would come eventually.

00:34.960 --> 00:36.990
I'm sorry I deceived you.

00:38.030 --> 00:39.260
I, too,

00:40.000 --> 00:44.130
will be released. Finally...

00:50.250 --> 00:51.610
Grandma...

00:54.220 --> 00:55.840
Grandma!

02:28.310 --> 02:32.310
The

02:28.310 --> 02:32.310
Guardians'

02:28.310 --> 02:32.310
Awakening

02:28.980 --> 02:33.940
Lady Baba has sacrificed herself to the duty of the Tamayori princess.

02:41.520 --> 02:43.150
How could this have happened?

02:45.160 --> 02:47.690
I guess good things can come from the unexpected.

02:50.430 --> 02:54.470
Are you unable to feel pain for a person's death?

02:54.470 --> 02:56.300
I do hurt.

02:56.300 --> 02:58.840
We cannot seal the Onikirimaru.

02:58.840 --> 03:01.440
And to have it stolen at the end...

03:01.440 --> 03:03.810
The previous generation has died in vain.

03:03.810 --> 03:05.180
Shut it!

03:05.610 --> 03:07.250
Why don't you leave?

03:07.250 --> 03:09.810
We have no desire to listen to you.

03:10.490 --> 03:12.120
You'll regret it.

03:12.120 --> 03:13.620
Of course we won't.

03:13.620 --> 03:14.780
Leave.

03:16.120 --> 03:20.320
Very well. You'll just have to rack those brains you don't have.

03:25.130 --> 03:28.470
I'm going to stop Eins and the Onikirimaru.

03:28.470 --> 03:29.660
Wait, Takuma.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.870
I'll go, too.

03:34.540 --> 03:39.280
If we leave Onikirimaru as it is, the world will perish.

03:40.080 --> 03:42.480
I have to be the one to stop it,

03:42.480 --> 03:45.780
the one and only Tamayori princess in this world.

03:46.220 --> 03:47.880
It's the obvious thing to do.

03:54.860 --> 03:56.330
Tamayori princess.

04:02.570 --> 04:03.830
Please...

04:04.670 --> 04:06.230
Lend me your strength.

04:15.880 --> 04:17.580
I give you my allegiance.

04:40.380 --> 04:41.430
What is this?

04:42.440 --> 04:44.610
The Osaki Fox's spirit power.

04:45.910 --> 04:47.210
O-chan's?

04:51.590 --> 04:53.250
Tamayori princess,

04:54.090 --> 04:55.580
these are yours.

04:56.720 --> 04:58.960
We exist for your sake.

04:59.960 --> 05:02.430
Tell us your wishes.

05:02.430 --> 05:07.460
Let's sever the root of sadness together, Suguru.

05:07.840 --> 05:09.430
As you wish.

05:16.610 --> 05:20.150
I am one with the Tamayori princess,

05:20.150 --> 05:23.590
and Tamaki is one with us.

05:24.190 --> 05:25.450
Is that all right?

05:25.450 --> 05:28.750
Yes, Yuichi. That is what I wish.

05:33.630 --> 05:34.600
Tamaki.

05:35.560 --> 05:39.090
I will no longer lose to the weakness in my heart.

05:39.530 --> 05:42.900
You are my Tamayori princess and my respected senpai.

05:43.440 --> 05:45.540
I want to be your guardian.

05:45.540 --> 05:47.740
Shinji, you are my guardian.

05:52.380 --> 05:54.610
I never cared about being a guardian.

05:55.080 --> 05:57.810
In fact, I even resented it.

05:59.290 --> 06:02.520
But if you're the Tamayori princess, perhaps I could accept it.

06:03.490 --> 06:05.790
Thank you for saying so.

06:10.570 --> 06:14.500
Can you suppress the Onikirimaru, Tamaki?

06:14.500 --> 06:17.440
I will suppress it, Mahiro.

06:17.440 --> 06:21.740
Then I'll defeat that bearded bastard and protect you.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.350
Tamaki.

06:31.850 --> 06:34.880
I won't tell you to run anymore.

06:35.420 --> 06:38.120
Come fight with us!

06:40.090 --> 06:41.360
Yes.

06:46.400 --> 06:49.100
What's this? I can feel power welling up.

06:49.100 --> 06:51.010
What a strange feeling.

06:51.010 --> 06:52.030
Yes.

06:54.380 --> 06:56.180
It isn't bad.

06:56.180 --> 07:03.350
This must be because we have now, truly, become guardians.

07:04.220 --> 07:07.620
Because you awakened as the Tamayori princess,

07:07.620 --> 07:09.790
we were able to become guardians.

07:09.790 --> 07:13.160
No, it's because you were all here for me.

07:15.960 --> 07:19.490
<i>The awakening that seemed so difficult and far away...</i>

07:21.570 --> 07:24.130
<i>It doesn't feel like anything has changed,</i>

07:26.070 --> 07:27.740
<i>but I can believe in everyone.</i>

07:29.610 --> 07:33.380
<i>Now, let's go to stop the Onikirimaru.</i>

08:15.520 --> 08:16.250
How?

08:17.290 --> 08:19.920
It's all right, Tamaki. We're here.

08:20.530 --> 08:21.120
Okay.

08:26.170 --> 08:28.000
So you've come, demons.

08:28.670 --> 08:31.230
I have overcome fate.

08:31.770 --> 08:34.980
I stand at the summit.

08:34.980 --> 08:36.840
I am a god.

08:37.480 --> 08:41.320
To speak of fate and godhood through a power gained by killing,

08:41.320 --> 08:42.840
you really are a fool.

08:43.280 --> 08:44.320
Silence.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.520
Wait.

08:45.520 --> 08:49.180
Eins, we'd like to avoid fighting you if we could.

08:49.860 --> 08:53.190
Tell me, what drives you to do this?

08:53.930 --> 08:56.960
I have nothing left to say.

08:57.400 --> 08:59.000
Time cannot return...

08:59.000 --> 09:01.630
what has passed has been forgotten.

09:02.370 --> 09:07.870
It seems as though the Artifact desires your death, Sybil.

09:10.440 --> 09:12.410
I won't let anyone kill her.

09:13.080 --> 09:15.110
That's what I decided!

09:20.320 --> 09:21.850
Is that all you have?

09:22.690 --> 09:24.960
How worthless you are, demon.

09:25.430 --> 09:28.400
With that which you must protect before you,

09:28.400 --> 09:31.870
you hesitate to exercise your power, you coward.

09:31.870 --> 09:32.560
What did you say?

09:33.870 --> 09:36.430
All of you are the same.

09:37.370 --> 09:39.700
Silence that mouth!

09:45.450 --> 09:46.210
Flames!

09:47.420 --> 09:48.180
Emerge!

10:11.740 --> 10:13.040
What did I tell you?

10:13.610 --> 10:16.870
But to be unable to defeat him six on one...

10:17.450 --> 10:20.880
I suppose that's the power of the gods for you.

10:21.280 --> 10:22.050
Ashiya?

10:23.480 --> 10:24.450
Stay back!

10:28.060 --> 10:29.290
Even so,

10:29.290 --> 10:31.920
I'm counting on you guardians.

10:32.260 --> 10:33.920
I need you to do your best.

10:35.000 --> 10:37.860
What are you plotting?

10:38.070 --> 10:39.860
World peace.

10:41.270 --> 10:42.960
Just listen.

10:43.140 --> 10:46.940
It's not like the Bureau of Medicine wants the end of the world.

10:47.140 --> 10:50.240
We've always thought we'd like to bring world peace.

10:51.050 --> 10:56.140
I've always thought this world needed something absolute.

10:57.320 --> 11:01.280
An absolute justice that you could absolutely believe in.

11:02.190 --> 11:03.250
Absolute?

11:07.260 --> 11:11.260
You could even call that absolute something a god.

11:12.370 --> 11:18.500
The Onikirimaru, or the power within, should be used for the sake of the world.

11:21.040 --> 11:25.050
How do you plan to obtain that power?

11:25.050 --> 11:26.150
Who knows?

11:26.150 --> 11:28.680
I'll leave that to the guardians,

11:28.680 --> 11:31.350
but as long as we keep the
Tamayori princess in our hands,

11:31.350 --> 11:33.790
I'm sure it'll make its own way to us.

11:34.590 --> 11:37.650
Deception, conspiracy, bluffing.

11:38.190 --> 11:42.430
The way you smell makes my stomach turn!

12:19.300 --> 12:21.200
Move, Takuma!

12:25.370 --> 12:29.240
True men can overcome their limitations for the sake

12:29.240 --> 12:31.110
or protecting that which they must protect!

12:35.250 --> 12:37.650
I'll believe in myself.

12:39.120 --> 12:42.420
I'll believe in my friends, the Tamayori princess, and Tamaki.

12:43.020 --> 12:43.960
Therefore,

12:44.860 --> 12:46.020
I will win!

12:47.730 --> 12:49.700
My body is steel.

12:49.700 --> 12:51.060
My hands are shields.

12:51.630 --> 12:54.860
Nothing can harm me!

12:57.270 --> 13:02.010
Sacrifice and seals and the power to end the world...

13:02.310 --> 13:04.400
Let us destroy it all together.

13:05.410 --> 13:08.040
Endless summoning circle, appear!

13:14.120 --> 13:15.020
Flame!

13:38.610 --> 13:39.610
Takuma!

13:39.610 --> 13:41.380
Splendid.

13:41.380 --> 13:45.750
The power of the gods, which is truly worthy of me.

13:47.520 --> 13:49.390
Did we keep you waiting?

13:50.160 --> 13:51.250
Aria!

13:52.630 --> 13:57.160
Aria, you should already know that that should not be in the world.

13:58.400 --> 14:01.270
It's no use asking her for help.

14:02.000 --> 14:04.900
That doll is more valuable to her.

14:05.370 --> 14:06.770
Doll?

14:07.070 --> 14:10.310
If it's nearby, emotions can be transferred to it.

14:10.310 --> 14:14.340
It sounds inexplicable to me.

14:15.220 --> 14:19.420
Now, Zwei, the time for the feast has arrived.

14:19.420 --> 14:21.890
Eat to your satisfaction.

14:22.490 --> 14:24.150
Crow...

14:27.190 --> 14:28.420
Mahiro!

14:29.600 --> 14:31.430
Damn it! At a time like this!

14:37.340 --> 14:41.040
I will dispose of all those who stand

14:41.040 --> 14:43.510
before me and the Artifact.

14:47.010 --> 14:49.180
Emerge, Beelzebub!

14:52.090 --> 14:53.990
My greatest shield!

14:58.660 --> 15:00.290
Go!

15:09.900 --> 15:11.340
Eliminate!

15:16.110 --> 15:17.240
Mitsuru!

15:17.240 --> 15:20.410
Standing in my way at time like this.

15:20.710 --> 15:21.840
In that case...

15:32.960 --> 15:36.230
Your magic will no longer work on me.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.800
Magic born from wicked thought.

15:39.800 --> 15:41.900
Single spear!

15:41.900 --> 15:43.230
Burn!

15:44.610 --> 15:45.970
I have no choice.

15:45.970 --> 15:51.440
I'll observe for the moment and watch the fools dance.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.750
Mitsuru!

15:58.750 --> 16:00.090
Why?

16:00.090 --> 16:01.320
Are you hurt?

16:01.320 --> 16:04.950
I'm all right, thanks to your protection.

16:05.330 --> 16:06.590
I'm glad...

16:07.090 --> 16:10.630
that even I could be of use.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.400
I'm glad, Brother.

16:20.340 --> 16:21.400
Crow.

16:22.740 --> 16:25.710
Your existence agitates my order!

16:25.710 --> 16:28.310
My order is shaken!

16:29.980 --> 16:31.790
I can hear a voice.

16:31.790 --> 16:32.950
What?

16:33.450 --> 16:35.360
I can hear a voice say "Help me."

16:38.290 --> 16:40.090
What? What are you saying?

16:43.730 --> 16:45.170
What are you?

16:47.530 --> 16:49.800
He who consumes souls,

16:49.800 --> 16:52.340
the abnormal power which has latched on to this man,

16:52.340 --> 16:55.800
that which you humans have come to call "death god."

16:58.080 --> 17:00.740
So mankind still has initiative?

17:01.480 --> 17:05.320
I'll let you consume his soul soon enough. Silence, soul eater.

17:07.760 --> 17:09.690
Your smell of death has vanished.

17:09.690 --> 17:11.160
What happened?

17:11.160 --> 17:12.430
Nothing really.

17:12.430 --> 17:16.060
I just learned what it means to protect something.

17:16.060 --> 17:17.730
And not by sacrifice!

17:17.730 --> 17:20.930
Crow, my agitator!

17:26.470 --> 17:28.840
I've finally grasped that initiative!

17:29.310 --> 17:31.870
You're the source of Zwei's power.

17:32.650 --> 17:35.450
The negative power that ruins gods!

17:36.150 --> 17:37.920
I will devour...

17:37.920 --> 17:39.580
your soul!

17:42.060 --> 17:43.220
Tamayori.

17:43.890 --> 17:45.860
That which stands against me.

17:46.390 --> 17:49.490
Who are you? Eins or...?

17:50.600 --> 17:55.330
I hate, and will thus destroy...

17:56.040 --> 17:58.030
everything!

18:01.910 --> 18:03.240
Is this a god?

18:03.610 --> 18:05.740
No, the end of the world?

18:08.680 --> 18:10.340
I won't let that happen!

18:10.950 --> 18:11.710
Takuma!

18:11.990 --> 18:13.010
Tamaki!

18:13.350 --> 18:14.950
Give me power!

18:15.960 --> 18:16.890
Takuma!

18:34.780 --> 18:37.780
What a splendid feeling.

18:37.780 --> 18:41.080
This is the Artifact, the power of the gods.

18:45.720 --> 18:51.420
All beings, fall prostrate before me as
I ascend the stairway to heaven!

18:52.160 --> 18:53.250
Magus...

18:54.090 --> 18:56.290
The power of the gods is in my hands.

18:56.900 --> 19:00.160
Sybil and Sybil's Artifacts are burdened by restraint.

19:01.100 --> 19:05.310
In that case, now that the true Artifact has been freed,

19:05.310 --> 19:08.610
Monado Aria, you are unnecessary.

19:09.180 --> 19:11.440
You think you can control Sybil?

19:12.050 --> 19:15.310
Now that I possess the power of the gods, it's a simple task.

19:16.850 --> 19:20.820
But first, pray for your departure, Monado Aria.

19:20.820 --> 19:22.310
I won't let you!

19:25.630 --> 19:27.160
Vier?

19:27.160 --> 19:30.290
You. How did you escape from my cage?

19:30.760 --> 19:32.820
Aria is my master.

19:33.300 --> 19:36.630
My duty is to protect her with my life.

19:37.340 --> 19:41.070
I will not forgive anything that harms her.

19:42.180 --> 19:43.970
Then die.

19:48.950 --> 19:49.850
Why?

19:50.450 --> 19:53.050
I'm the one who freed you from boredom.

19:53.050 --> 19:55.220
You cursed your own birth,

19:55.220 --> 19:58.990
and you should have resented the
Ugaya house and the Tamayori princess.

19:59.860 --> 20:01.290
That's right.

20:01.560 --> 20:04.960
But now there is something more unforgivable.

20:05.870 --> 20:10.830
Bastards like you who try to take a cut from everyone else!

20:25.690 --> 20:27.380
Are you back to yourself?

20:27.590 --> 20:30.560
What happened to that weird soul eater guy?

20:31.360 --> 20:34.350
He is wounded and sleeping inside me.

20:35.860 --> 20:39.130
Since meeting you,
I've often heard his voice,

20:40.030 --> 20:41.400
saying "help me."

20:42.600 --> 20:44.160
That was me.

20:45.410 --> 20:48.570
It's not that my soul was devoured.

20:49.740 --> 20:50.610
You...

20:51.380 --> 20:53.010
If you're going to kill me, do it now.

20:53.450 --> 20:57.890
But the soul eater will try to keep me alive at all costs.

21:01.020 --> 21:02.520
I cannot hold back.

21:02.520 --> 21:03.790
Fine by me.

21:03.790 --> 21:07.090
With your soul on the line, give me one shot.

21:08.130 --> 21:09.600
Tell me your name.

21:10.400 --> 21:12.200
I am Mahiro Atori.

21:12.670 --> 21:14.500
Hugo Stingrail.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.040
Now!

21:16.040 --> 21:17.060
Come!

21:28.880 --> 21:31.750
Now it's finally over...

23:34.510 --> 23:38.310
If you weren't here, I wouldn't exist.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.920
Thank you.

23:43.350 --> 23:46.180
You became my reason for living.

23:50.020 --> 23:53.520
Stay by my side from now on.

23:55.200 --> 24:00.930
Next time: The Eternal Pledge
